@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = paste-access-token-here
# Get a token from AUTH-02 (POST /auth/login) and paste it into @token.
# Seeded logins: admin@brightloop.test / Admin@12345, staff@brightloop.test / Staff@12345, customer@brightloop.test / Customer@12345
# Ids follow a fresh `migrate:fresh --seed`: plan 1 = Monthly Starter, products 1 = Business Suite (variant 1 = Brand: Odoo),
# 2 = CRM Seat, 3 = Extra Storage 100GB, customer 2 = Acme Corp, payment term 2 = Net 15, template 1 = Standard SMB Offer,
# discount 2 = Loyalty 500 Off. Subscriptions: 7 draft, 9 quotation, 10 confirmed, 1 active (Monthly Starter). Replace as needed.

### TPL-01 List quotation templates (A,S) - add all=1 for dropdown mode
GET {{baseUrl}}/quotation-templates?search=SMB&page=1&per_page=15
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### TPL-02 Create quotation template (A,S)
POST {{baseUrl}}/quotation-templates
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Business Suite Offer",
  "validity_days": 21,
  "plan_id": 1,
  "notes": "Suite with Odoo branding and two CRM seats",
  "lines": [
    { "product_id": 1, "variant_id": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "product_id": 2, "variant_id": null, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### TPL-03 Show quotation template (A,S)
GET {{baseUrl}}/quotation-templates/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### TPL-04 Update quotation template, lines replaced (A,S)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/quotation-templates/2
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Business Suite Offer (revised)",
  "validity_days": 30,
  "plan_id": 1,
  "notes": null,
  "lines": [
    { "product_id": 1, "variant_id": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "product_id": 3, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### TPL-05 Delete quotation template, soft (A,S)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/quotation-templates/2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SUB-01 List subscriptions (A,S all; C own)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions?status=active&is_paused=false&search=Acme&sort=created_at&direction=desc&page=1&per_page=15
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SUB-02 Create subscription (A,S) - from template: plan and lines are copied when absent
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "customer_id": 2,
  "quotation_template_id": 1,
  "payment_term_id": 2,
  "start_date": "2026-11-01",
  "expiry_date": "2027-10-31",
  "notes": "Created from Standard SMB Offer"
}

### SUB-03 Show subscription (A,S; C own)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/7
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SUB-04 Update subscription, draft|quotation only (A,S)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/7
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "plan_id": 1,
  "quotation_template_id": null,
  "payment_term_id": 2,
  "start_date": "2026-11-01",
  "expiry_date": "2027-10-31",
  "notes": "Three seats plus storage",
  "lines": [
    { "product_id": 2, "variant_id": null, "quantity": 3 },
    { "product_id": 3, "variant_id": null, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### SUB-05 Delete subscription, draft only (A,S)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/8
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SUB-06 Send quotation: draft -> quotation (A,S)
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/7/send-quotation
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SUB-07 Confirm: quotation -> confirmed (A,S)
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/9/confirm
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SUB-08 Activate: confirmed -> active (A,S)
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/10/activate
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SUB-09 Pause (A,S,C own)
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/1/pause
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SUB-10 Resume (A,S,C own)
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/1/resume
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SUB-11 Close (A,S,C own)
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/1/close
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "reason": "Customer moved to another provider"
}

### SUB-12 Renew (A,S,C own) - new_expiry_date must be after the current expiry_date
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/2/renew
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "new_expiry_date": "2028-12-31"
}

### SUB-13 Attach discount (A,S) - applies_to=subscription and state=active
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/2/discounts
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "discount_id": 2
}

### SUB-14 Detach discount (A,S)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/2/discounts/2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
